---
layout: none
permalink: /rss.xml
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  네이버 서치어드바이저용 RSS 2.0 피드.
  jekyll-feed 가 만드는 /feed.xml 은 Atom 이라 네이버가 "형식이 올바르지 않습니다" 로 거부한다.
  구글·일반 리더는 계속 /feed.xml 을 쓰면 된다.
  pubDate 는 RSS 2.0 규격상 RFC-822 여야 한다 (date_to_rfc822).
{%- endcomment -%}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom">
  <channel>
    <title>{{ site.title | xml_escape }}</title>
    <link>{{ '/' | absolute_url }}</link>
    <description>{{ site.description | xml_escape }}</description>
    <language>ko</language>
    <lastBuildDate>{{ site.time | date_to_rfc822 }}</lastBuildDate>
    <atom:link href="{{ '/rss.xml' | absolute_url }}" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" />
    {%- for post in site.posts limit: 50 %}
    <item>
      <title>{{ post.title | strip_html | xml_escape }}</title>
      <link>{{ post.url | absolute_url }}</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">{{ post.url | absolute_url }}</guid>
      <pubDate>{{ post.date | date_to_rfc822 }}</pubDate>
      <description>{{ post.description | default: post.excerpt | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 400 | xml_escape }}</description>
      <author>{{ site.author.email_text | xml_escape }} ({{ site.author.name | xml_escape }})</author>
      {%- for tag in post.tags %}
      <category>{{ tag | xml_escape }}</category>
      {%- endfor %}
    </item>
    {%- endfor %}
  </channel>
</rss>
